# Custom
tmp
# docs/superpowers is local agent planning scratch (tasks/, specs/, discoveries/,
# other plans/) and stays untracked, EXCEPT the E2E coverage catalog: that file
# is a CI-enforced artifact (.agents/rules/e2e-coverage-required.md) and must be
# committed for the rule to be checkable — see issue #160.
docs/superpowers/*
!docs/superpowers/plans
docs/superpowers/plans/*
!docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-27-e2e-coverage-enhancement.md
.superpowers
.worktrees
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/agents
.gitignore
.claude/rules
.claude/skills
.devin/agents
.devin/rules
.devin/skills
.playwright-mcp
packages/plugins/claude-session-sync/bin-e2e